    {
      "name": "cpms_charging_timeline",
      "description": "Read the authorized order raw charging-gun telemetry from the time-series store (charging-gun_property): rows ordered by ts within the order's createdTime~stopTime window on its childDeviceCode. This is the SOP §2.2 process source — use it when the monitor table (cpms_charging_samples) has no rows or a process question needs the raw stream: voltage/current/power/soc/errorCode over time. Read order detail first. Optional order_no is a candidate supplied by the user or the current conversation; authorization is checked for each call.",
      "inputs": [
        "order_no"
